# Keep the Docker build context small and deterministic.

# Dependencies and generated build output are rebuilt inside the images.
**/node_modules
**/.svelte-kit
**/build
**/dist
**/bin
**/obj
**/.vite

# Version control and editor state.
**/.git
**/.github
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/.idea

# Local tooling state and logs.
.kilo/worktrees
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Documentation is not needed to build the images.
docs
IFA_AI_Learning_Companion_Implementation_Plan_v3.md
